{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>For</b> — because he mentioned \"our shield,\" \"see, O Elohim,\" for the shield in truth is HaShem alone." "<b>And the meaning of sun</b> — because the festival-goers need the sun for their journey. Another meaning: because the sun strikes by day, he said against it \"and a shield.\"" "<b>And the meaning of \"grace and glory will YHWH give\"</b> — to those who walk a blameless path, namely the festival-goers, and HaShem will give them grace and glory in every place they pass through, for HaShem will not withhold from those who receive Him."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 84, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:02.913630582Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}